ここでg_i = \frac{ \partial l(y_i, \hat{y}^{(t-1)}) }{\partial \hat{y}^{(t-1)} }\\
h_i = \frac{ \partial^2 l(y_i, \hat{y}^{(t-1)}) }{\partial (\hat{y}^{(t-1)})^2 }

定数項を省略すると\tilde{\mathcal{L}}^{(t)} =
\sum^n_{i=1} [
     g_i f_t(x_i)
     + \frac{1}{2} h_i f_t^2(x_i)
]
